{
  "mode": "planned",
  "total": 82.0,
  "speech_rate_wpm": 193.3,
  "audio_offset": 0.0,
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "hook1",
      "text": "Every popcorn kernel is a *tiny pressure cooker.*",
      "start": 0.35,
      "end": 2.834
    },
    {
      "id": "hook2",
      "text": "And every single one",
      "start": 3.214,
      "end": 4.456
    },
    {
      "id": "hook3",
      "text": "is counting down to an *explosion.*",
      "start": 4.576,
      "end": 6.438
    },
    {
      "id": "ass1",
      "text": "Most people think heat just makes",
      "start": 7.188,
      "end": 9.051
    },
    {
      "id": "ass2",
      "text": "the corn *burst open.*",
      "start": 9.171,
      "end": 10.413
    },
    {
      "id": "ass3",
      "text": "But the real trick is *hiding inside.*",
      "start": 10.793,
      "end": 12.966
    },
    {
      "id": "an1",
      "text": "Each kernel holds a *tiny drop of water,*",
      "start": 13.716,
      "end": 16.2
    },
    {
      "id": "an2",
      "text": "about *fourteen percent* of its weight,",
      "start": 16.32,
      "end": 18.183
    },
    {
      "id": "an3",
      "text": "packed into *soft starch.*",
      "start": 18.303,
      "end": 19.544
    },
    {
      "id": "an4",
      "text": "Around it sits a *hard shell*",
      "start": 19.924,
      "end": 21.787
    },
    {
      "id": "an5",
      "text": "that barely lets anything out.",
      "start": 21.907,
      "end": 23.459
    },
    {
      "id": "pr1",
      "text": "Heat it up,",
      "start": 24.209,
      "end": 25.141
    },
    {
      "id": "pr2",
      "text": "and that water turns into *steam.*",
      "start": 25.261,
      "end": 27.124
    },
    {
      "id": "pr3",
      "text": "The shell *traps it.*",
      "start": 27.504,
      "end": 28.745
    },
    {
      "id": "pr4",
      "text": "Pressure climbs to nearly *ten times*",
      "start": 29.125,
      "end": 30.988
    },
    {
      "id": "pr5",
      "text": "normal air pressure,",
      "start": 31.108,
      "end": 32.04
    },
    {
      "id": "pr6",
      "text": "while the starch inside softens",
      "start": 32.16,
      "end": 33.712
    },
    {
      "id": "pr7",
      "text": "into a *hot gel.*",
      "start": 33.832,
      "end": 35.074
    },
    {
      "id": "bu1",
      "text": "At around *one hundred eighty degrees Celsius,*",
      "start": 35.824,
      "end": 37.997
    },
    {
      "id": "bu2",
      "text": "the shell finally *gives up.*",
      "start": 38.117,
      "end": 39.669
    },
    {
      "id": "fo1",
      "text": "In a split second,",
      "start": 40.419,
      "end": 41.661
    },
    {
      "id": "fo2",
      "text": "the steam *rushes out*",
      "start": 41.781,
      "end": 43.023
    },
    {
      "id": "fo3",
      "text": "and puffs the gel into a *foam,*",
      "start": 43.143,
      "end": 45.316
    },
    {
      "id": "fo4",
      "text": "up to *forty times bigger.*",
      "start": 45.436,
      "end": 46.989
    },
    {
      "id": "fo5",
      "text": "It cools almost instantly",
      "start": 47.369,
      "end": 48.61
    },
    {
      "id": "fo6",
      "text": "and sets into that *crunchy white cloud.*",
      "start": 48.73,
      "end": 50.904
    },
    {
      "id": "so1",
      "text": "And the *pop* you hear?",
      "start": 51.654,
      "end": 53.206
    },
    {
      "id": "so2",
      "text": "Scientists filmed it at",
      "start": 53.586,
      "end": 54.828
    },
    {
      "id": "so3",
      "text": "*thousands of frames per second.*",
      "start": 54.948,
      "end": 56.5
    },
    {
      "id": "so4",
      "text": "The sound comes from the *steam escaping,*",
      "start": 56.88,
      "end": 59.053
    },
    {
      "id": "so5",
      "text": "not from the *shell cracking.*",
      "start": 59.173,
      "end": 60.726
    },
    {
      "id": "ju1",
      "text": "Even the jump is wild:",
      "start": 61.106,
      "end": 62.658
    },
    {
      "id": "ju2",
      "text": "a little *leg of starch*",
      "start": 62.778,
      "end": 64.33
    },
    {
      "id": "ju3",
      "text": "kicks the kernel *into the air.*",
      "start": 64.45,
      "end": 66.313
    },
    {
      "id": "du1",
      "text": "The kernels that *never pop?*",
      "start": 67.063,
      "end": 68.615
    },
    {
      "id": "du2",
      "text": "Usually a *damaged or dried-out shell.*",
      "start": 68.995,
      "end": 70.858
    },
    {
      "id": "du3",
      "text": "The steam *leaks away,*",
      "start": 71.238,
      "end": 72.48
    },
    {
      "id": "du4",
      "text": "so the pressure *never builds.*",
      "start": 72.6,
      "end": 74.152
    },
    {
      "id": "end1",
      "text": "One drop of water, one tough shell,",
      "start": 74.902,
      "end": 77.075
    },
    {
      "id": "end2",
      "text": "one *tiny explosion.*",
      "start": 77.195,
      "end": 78.127
    },
    {
      "id": "end3",
      "text": "What everyday thing",
      "start": 78.507,
      "end": 79.438
    },
    {
      "id": "end4",
      "text": "should we *unpack next?*",
      "start": 79.558,
      "end": 80.8
    }
  ]
}